	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["08F62016A6F246E4"]
			description: [
				"&9One Small Step...&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/moon_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The &7Moon&r is humanity's first destination beyond the Overworld."
				""
				"After countless hours spent building machines, automating resources, and constructing your first spacecraft, the moment has finally arrived to leave your home world behind. Standing upon the launch pad, you'll begin a journey that transforms your factory into an interplanetary space program."
				""
				"The stars are no longer out of reach."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA Silent Frontier&r"
				""
				"The Moon is a harsh and unforgiving world."
				""
				"With no breathable atmosphere, freezing nights, and barren landscapes stretching endlessly across the horizon, every expedition demands careful planning. Bring oxygen supplies, reliable equipment, and everything needed to establish a safe foothold on the lunar surface."
				""
				"As you explore, you'll discover ancient structures, forgotten relics, valuable ores, and mysterious &6Molten Vents&r hidden beneath layers of lunar dust."
				""
				"Every crater holds another discovery waiting to be uncovered."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Beginning of Space Exploration&r"
				""
				"The Moon serves as the foundation for every mission that follows."
				""
				"Gather its unique resources, conquer its dangerous structures, and establish the infrastructure needed to continue your journey across the solar system. The knowledge and materials recovered here will unlock new technologies, more powerful rockets, and the ability to reach even more distant worlds."
				""
				"Every great space program begins with a single successful landing."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The Moon is more than your first planet."
				""
				"It is the beginning of humanity's greatest adventure."
				""
				"Take your first step beyond Earth..."
				""
				"And let the journey to the stars truly begin."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "ad_astra:moon_globe"
