		{
			dependencies: ["5B64CE917218050A"]
			description: [
				"&fWelcome to Mars: The Crimson Frontier&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/mars_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Beyond the silent plains of the Moon lies your next great destination: &cMars&r."
				""
				"Its crimson deserts, towering cliffs, and windswept valleys stretch endlessly beneath a pale sky, preserving the remnants of a civilization long forgotten. Though the planet appears lifeless, ancient structures and hidden treasures remain buried beneath its rust-colored surface, waiting for explorers bold enough to uncover them."
				""
				"Every expedition reveals another piece of Mars' forgotten history."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA World of Ancient Ruins&r"
				""
				"Mars offers far more than barren landscapes."
				""
				"Scattered across the planet are mysterious ruins, dangerous dungeons, and powerful enemies guarding resources unavailable anywhere else in the solar system. Venture into forgotten temples, explore abandoned towers, and gather the rare materials needed to construct more advanced rockets and continue humanity's journey into deep space."
				""
				"The greatest discoveries belong to those willing to brave the unknown."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Next Giant Leap&r"
				""
				"Surviving Mars demands preparation, determination, and a factory capable of supporting life beyond Earth."
				""
				"Bring reliable oxygen supplies, powerful equipment, and everything needed to withstand the harsh conditions of the Red Planet. The resources recovered here will fuel your next technological breakthroughs and prepare you for the even greater challenges awaiting on Mercury, Venus, and beyond."
				""
				"The Moon proved you could reach the stars."
				""
				"Mars will prove you belong among them."
			]
