		{
			dependencies: ["5930A1E4723BBE2A"]
			description: [
				"&cMercury: Trial by Fire&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/mercury_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Mercury is the most unforgiving world you've encountered since leaving the Overworld."
				""
				"Scorched by the relentless heat of the nearby sun, its cracked surface is a barren wasteland of molten rock, blackened stone, and ancient ruins slowly consumed by fire. Life is almost nonexistent here, yet the planet still guards powerful secrets beneath its burning skies."
				""
				"Survival is not guaranteed."
				""
				"Every step across Mercury is a test of endurance."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA World Forged in Flame&r"
				""
				"Unlike the worlds you've explored before, Mercury offers few natural resources upon its surface."
				""
				"Instead, your greatest rewards lie hidden within the planet's dangerous structures. Explore the mysterious &6Forbidden Castle&r, descend into the deadly &cMercury Arena Dungeon&r, and challenge the powerful enemies guarding their forgotten treasures. The rare materials recovered here are essential for advancing your journey across the solar system."
				""
				"Only those willing to brave the flames will uncover Mercury's greatest riches."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lOnly the Strong Survive&r"
				""
				"Preparation is everything before setting foot on Mercury."
				""
				"Bring reliable oxygen supplies, strong armor, plentiful food, and equipment capable of withstanding one of the harshest environments in the solar system. Every victory here brings you closer to constructing more advanced rockets and unlocking the distant worlds that still await beyond."
				""
				"The fires of Mercury do not seek to destroy you."
				""
				"They exist to forge you into a stronger explorer."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			hide_dependent_lines: true
