		{
			dependencies: ["6B54577F45BDF5E7"]
			description: [
				"&6Forge the Netherite Space Suit&r"
				""
				"Mercury is one of the most hostile planets in the solar system. Its blistering temperatures and relentless solar exposure make the planet extremely dangerous for unprepared explorers. The moment you step onto its scorched surface, the environment itself becomes your greatest enemy."
				""
				"Without proper protection, survival will be short-lived."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPreparing for Mercury&r"
				""
				"To safely explore Mercury, you must upgrade your equipment and craft the &6Netherite Space Suit&r. This specialized suit is engineered to withstand the planet's extreme conditions, providing the protection necessary to survive its unforgiving environment."
				""
				"Unlike previous worlds, Mercury cannot simply be conquered through preparation alone—you must have the proper gear before setting foot on the planet."
				""
				"The Netherite Space Suit is not a luxury."
				""
				"It is a necessity."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"With your suit complete, you will finally be ready to brave Mercury's blazing wastelands, explore its ancient structures, and uncover the resources hidden beneath its scorched surface."
				""
				"The heat is relentless."
				""
				"The challenge is immense."
				""
				"But the rewards awaiting those who endure are well worth the risk."
			]
