		{
			dependencies: ["5930A1E4723BBE2A"]
			description: [
				"&dVenus: Into the Storm&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/venus_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Beyond the blazing surface of Mercury lies one of the most hostile worlds in the solar system: &dVenus&r."
				""
				"Blanketed beneath toxic clouds and battered by relentless electrical storms, this planet is a place where survival is never guaranteed. Powerful winds sweep across its scorched landscape while sulfuric skies conceal the remnants of civilizations long consumed by fire and ash."
				""
				"Every expedition is a battle against the planet itself."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA World Shrouded in Mystery&r"
				""
				"Although Venus offers few natural resources upon its surface, its forgotten structures contain treasures of immeasurable value."
				""
				"Explore ancient ruins hidden beneath the poisonous atmosphere, uncover abandoned settlements, and venture into dangerous dungeons guarded by powerful enemies. The rare materials recovered from these forgotten places are essential for constructing future rockets and continuing your journey beyond the inner solar system."
				""
				"The greatest rewards lie hidden beneath the storm."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lConquer the Tempest&r"
				""
				"Venus demands careful preparation before every mission."
				""
				"Equip your &8Netherite Space Suit&r, carry ample oxygen supplies, and bring powerful weapons capable of overcoming the planet's dangerous inhabitants. The harsh environment will test both your engineering and your determination, rewarding only those prepared to endure its relentless fury."
				""
				"Weather the storm."
				""
				"Uncover its forgotten secrets."
				""
				"And prove that not even the most hostile world can stand in the way of humanity's journey to the stars."
			]
