		{
			dependencies: ["196AF2DC09A4C1FE"]
			description: [
				"&bGlacio: The Frozen Frontier&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/glacio_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"At the very edge of the Ad Astra solar system lies &bGlacio&r, a world locked beneath an endless blanket of ice and snow."
				""
				"Towering glaciers, frozen mountain ranges, and windswept plains stretch across the horizon, creating one of the most beautiful—and unforgiving—environments you've encountered. Beneath the frozen landscape rest the remains of an ancient civilization, preserved by the relentless cold for countless ages."
				""
				"Every step across Glacio uncovers another frozen secret."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA Kingdom of Ice&r"
				""
				"Although its surface appears barren, Glacio is rich with resources found nowhere else in the solar system."
				""
				"Mine valuable &bFrostite&r deep beneath the ice, collect &bEtrium&r for advanced engineering, and explore ancient structures frozen in time. Hidden throughout the planet are dangerous dungeons, forgotten sanctuaries, and powerful enemies guarding the materials required for the next stage of your journey."
				""
				"Even the cold cannot preserve every secret forever."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Final World of Ad Astra&r"
				""
				"Glacio represents the culmination of your journey across the familiar planets of the solar system."
				""
				"Come prepared with reliable oxygen supplies, powerful armor, and the experience gained from every world you've conquered before. The resources recovered here will allow you to construct the &dTier 5 Rocket&r, opening the gateway to the extraordinary planets inspired by &bAlex's Caves&r and the adventures that await beyond the known frontier."
				""
				"The cold has tested your resolve."
				""
				"Now prepare to journey beyond the stars themselves."
			]
