		{
			dependencies: ["1523A7C10CEF69AA"]
			description: [
				"&7The Moon is far from lifeless. Beneath its silent surface and across its endless craters lie the remnants of forgotten civilizations, abandoned industrial operations, and dangerous strongholds waiting to be explored.&r"
				""
				"As you begin your journey across the lunar landscape, you will encounter a variety of structures filled with valuable resources, advanced technology, powerful enemies, and clues about those who once inhabited the Moon."
				""
				"Each structure offers unique rewards - but also unique dangers."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lMoon Tower Dungeon&r"
				"Constructed high above the lunar surface, the &fMoon Tower Dungeon&r stands as one of the Moon’s most dangerous ruins. Filled with hostile enemies and valuable loot, these towering structures challenge adventurers willing to climb their darkened halls in search of powerful rewards."
				""
				"Surviving the ascent may provide rare resources critical for future progression."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/moon_tower_dungeon.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPipeline&r"
				"Stretching across the barren lunar terrain, the massive industrial &6Pipeline&r appears to be a remnant of a forgotten mining or transport operation. Though partially abandoned, these structures still contain useful supplies and hidden loot for explorers willing to investigate their metallic corridors."
				""
				"Be cautious-many of these industrial routes are no longer stable."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/moon_pipeline.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lLunar Tower&r"
				"The imposing &7Lunar Tower&r rises from the Moon’s surface as a relic of ancient lunar engineering. Within its walls, you may uncover advanced technology, valuable materials, and dangerous foes protecting what remains inside."
				""
				"Exploring these towers can greatly aid your progression across the Moon and beyond."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/lunar_tower.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lLunarian Village&r"
				"Not all remnants of the Moon are hostile. Hidden among the craters, you may discover a &eLunarian Village&r - a rare settlement inhabited by lunar villagers attempting to survive the harsh conditions of space."
				""
				"These villages can provide shelter, trading opportunities, and valuable supplies for weary explorers far from home."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/lunarian_village.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lMoon Dungeon&r"
				"Deep beneath the Moon’s quiet surface lie the dangerous &8Moon Dungeons&r. These underground strongholds are filled with hostile creatures, traps, and hidden treasures waiting to be uncovered."
				""
				"Those brave enough to delve into these ruins may discover rare loot and resources essential for advancing further into the stars."
				""
				"Prepare carefully before entering-these dungeons are not forgiving."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/moon_dungeon.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
			]
