		{
			dependencies: ["1523A7C10CEF69AA"]
			description: [
				"&7The path to Mars begins here. With the Moon conquered and its resources secured, it is time to construct the next generation of spacecraft and continue humanity’s expansion into the stars.&r"
				""
				"The &cTier 2 Rocket&r represents a significant leap forward in engineering, requiring more advanced materials, improved manufacturing, and a factory capable of supporting large-scale space exploration."
				""
				"Every production line expanded and every resource automated brings you one step closer to the Red Planet."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lBuilding for the Journey Ahead&r"
				""
				"Unlike the Tier 1 Rocket, the &cTier 2 Rocket&r demands more sophisticated components and a greater investment in infrastructure. Stronger materials, improved propulsion systems, and specialized spacecraft components are all required to survive the journey to Mars."
				""
				"Constructing this vessel will test the efficiency of your factory and your ability to scale production beyond the needs of a single launch."
				""
				"Need help crafting a specific rocket component?"
				""
				"Consult &6JEI&r for detailed recipes and production requirements for all rocket parts."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As the final systems are installed and your rocket stands ready upon the launch pad, a new chapter of exploration begins."
				""
				"The Moon was only the first step."
				""
				"Now, your sights are set on another world."
			]
