		{
			dependencies: ["68C7C94DC68BF22E"]
			description: [
				"Hidden among the craters and shadows of the Moon’s surface, the &6Aubrum Vent&r quietly pulses with extraterrestrial energy. These celestial ore stones are essential for &lDesh&r production, a key component in early space technology and automation."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/aubrum_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To begin automation, locate a &lDormant Aubrum Vent&r under the Moon's pale glow. Feed a blaze burner blaze cake atop its surface to awaken the buried vent and reveal its inner power."
				""
				"Once activated, provide &dcheese&r and connect it to a &lMechanical Extruder&r to automate Desh like never before."
				""
				" &eThe Moon offers its blessing-will you accept the gift of Aubrum and fuel your journey to the stars?&r"
