		{
			dependencies: ["59D5B8DD8372D306"]
			description: [
				"&7With the &cTier 2 Rocket&r complete, a new frontier awaits beyond the stars.&r"
				""
				"Congratulations, explorer! Your growing space program has reached another major milestone. The path to &4Mars&r is now open, granting access to a world of ancient ruins, hidden treasures, and dangerous challenges waiting to be uncovered."
				""
				"The Red Planet marks the next stage of your journey across the solar system."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lSet Course for Mars&r"
				""
				"Fuel your rocket, prepare your equipment, and begin the journey to humanity's next great destination."
				""
				"Upon arrival, you'll discover a harsh and mysterious world shaped by countless ages of history. Throughout the planet, you'll encounter:"
				""
				"- &oAncient structures&r hiding valuable loot and forgotten secrets."
				"- &oDangerous enemies&r guarding powerful resources."
				"- &oRare materials&r required for future technological advancements."
				"- &oUnique challenges&r unlike anything found on the Moon."
				""
				"Every expedition into the Martian wilderness offers new opportunities for discovery."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Mars is more than just another planet."
				""
				"It is a proving ground for explorers seeking to push beyond the limits of known space."
				""
				"Its crimson deserts conceal powerful relics, ancient mysteries, and the resources needed to continue your journey deeper into the cosmos."
				""
				"The question is no longer whether you can reach Mars."
				""
				"The question is what you will discover when you arrive."
			]
