		{
			dependencies: ["0FD77C737AFB7625"]
			description: [
				"Hidden atop the red sands of Mars lies the &5Stellaris Vent&r, a radiant molten geyser glowing with interplanetary power. These vents form the foundation of &dOstrum&r automation, an advanced alloy vital to space-age engineering."
				""
