		{
			dependencies: ["6169F8EB0E600750"]
			description: [
				"&7With Mars behind you, the next stage of your journey leads to two of the most dangerous worlds in the solar system: Mercury and Venus.&r"
				""
				"Constructing the &6Tier 3 Rocket&r marks another major milestone in your space program, unlocking access to planets defined by extreme environments, powerful resources, and formidable challenges."
				""
				"The road ahead will require greater automation, stronger infrastructure, and the determination to push beyond the limits of conventional exploration."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lEngineering for Extreme Worlds&r"
				""
				"The &6Tier 3 Rocket&r is built to withstand conditions far beyond those encountered on the Moon or Mars. Reaching Mercury and Venus requires advanced spacecraft systems, reinforced materials, and specialized components capable of enduring hostile planetary environments."
				""
				"As your factory continues to expand, production chains become more complex and resource demands continue to grow. Efficient automation and large-scale manufacturing are essential to supporting your next generation of spacecraft."
				""
				"Need help crafting a specific rocket component?"
				""
				"Consult &6JEI&r for detailed recipes and production requirements for all rocket parts."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As the final components are assembled and the launch sequence begins, a new frontier opens before you."
				""
				"The age of planetary exploration has truly begun."
			]
