		{
			dependencies: ["586133B7C1877C61"]
			description: [
				"&7With the &6Tier 3 Rocket&r complete, your journey carries you deeper into the solar system than ever before.&r"
				""
				"Congratulations, explorer! You have unlocked access to two of the most hostile and mysterious worlds known to humanity: &6Mercury&r and &eVenus&r. Each planet offers unique resources, dangerous environments, and powerful challenges that will test both your preparation and your determination."
				""
				"The age of true planetary exploration has begun."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lMercury&r"
				""
				"Scorched by the relentless heat of the sun, &6Mercury&r is a world of blazing wastelands, ancient ruins, and hidden treasures waiting to be uncovered."
				""
				"Those capable of surviving its extreme environment will discover:"
				""
				"- &oAncient structures&r filled with valuable loot."
				"- &oRare resources&r required for future progression."
				"- &oPowerful enemies&r guarding forgotten secrets."
				"- Unique challenges unlike anything encountered on previous planets."
				""
				"Mercury rewards only the most prepared explorers."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lVenus&r"
				""
				"Beneath its toxic atmosphere and hostile surface lies a world rich with mystery and discovery."
				""
				"Across Venus, you will encounter:"
				""
				"- &oAncient ruins&r hidden beneath the clouds."
				"- &oDangerous structures&r filled with valuable rewards."
				"- Unique resources essential for advanced technology."
				"- Powerful enemies protecting the planet's secrets."
				""
				"Though its environment is harsh, Venus offers opportunities that cannot be found anywhere else in the solar system."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Mercury and Venus represent a significant step forward in your journey among the stars."
				""
				"Their resources will fuel future advancements, their challenges will test your abilities, and their secrets will prepare you for the worlds that still lie ahead."
				""
				"The frontier grows ever larger."
				""
				"Now it's time to discover what awaits beyond the horizon."
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:mercury_globe"
			id: "5930A1E4723BBE2A"
