		{
			dependencies: ["25721A33E1238EBD"]
			description: [
				"&7At the edge of the known solar system lies Glacio, a frozen world of endless ice fields, ancient structures, and relentless storms.&r"
				""
				"The construction of the &bTier 4 Rocket&r marks the culmination of your journey through the Ad Astra planets, granting access to the final frontier of humanity's expansion among the stars. Reaching Glacio will require advanced manufacturing, powerful automation, and a factory capable of supporting the most ambitious expedition yet."
				""
				"Every challenge overcome and every world explored has led to this moment."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lEngineering the Final Planetary Rocket&r"
				""
				"The &bTier 4 Rocket&r is the most advanced spacecraft developed throughout the Ad Astra progression path. Its construction requires sophisticated components, refined materials, and production chains spanning multiple dimensions and planets."
				""
				"By now, your factory should be operating at an industrial scale, transforming vast quantities of resources into the machinery and components needed to support deep-space exploration."
				""
				"Need help crafting a specific rocket component?"
				""
				"Consult &6JEI&r for detailed recipes and production requirements for all rocket parts."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As the launch countdown reaches zero and the engines roar to life, you prepare for the final journey across the Ad Astra system."
				""
				"The Moon, Mars, Mercury, and Venus are now behind you."
				""
				"Ahead lies Glacio—the last planetary frontier before your adventure expands into even stranger worlds beyond the stars."
			]
