		{
			dependencies: ["18FE88DC4331C399"]
			description: [
				"&7With the &bTier 4 Rocket&r complete, you are ready to journey to the outermost frontier of the solar system.&r"
				""
				"Congratulations, explorer! Your growing space program has reached its final destination within the known worlds of Ad Astra. Beyond the inner planets lies &bGlacio&r, a frozen world shrouded in snowstorms, ancient ruins, and mysteries locked beneath centuries of ice."
				""
				"Prepare your equipment, fuel your rocket, and set course for the solar system's most distant frontier."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lWelcome to Glacio&r"
				""
				"Upon arrival, you will find yourself in a harsh and unforgiving environment where survival is as important as exploration."
				""
				"Scattered throughout the frozen landscape are:"
				""
				"- &oAncient structures&r containing valuable loot and forgotten secrets."
				"- &oDangerous enemies&r guarding powerful rewards."
				"- &oRare resources&r required for advanced progression."
				"- &oMysterious landmarks&r hidden beneath the snow and ice."
				""
				"Every expedition into Glacio's frozen wilderness offers new opportunities for discovery."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Though its surface may appear lifeless, Glacio hides countless secrets beneath its frozen crust."
				""
				"From abandoned ruins to ancient relics preserved by the cold, the planet rewards those willing to brave its harsh environment and venture into the unknown."
				""
				"The challenges here are significant, but so are the rewards."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Glacio represents the final frontier of your planetary journey."
				""
				"Its resources, structures, and mysteries will prepare you for the challenges that lie beyond the End and the worlds that await afterward."
				""
				"The cold is relentless."
				""
				"The frontier is unforgiving."
				""
				"But great discoveries await those willing to push onward."
			]
