		{
			dependencies: ["6B54577F45BDF5E7"]
			description: [
				"Forged into the blazing crust of Mercury stands the &6Burning Arena&r, a colossal battleground surrounded by fire, molten stone, and the echoes of ancient combat."
				""
				"Within this infernal arena resides &cIgnis&r, a legendary warrior bound to flame and fury. Armed with a molten shield and a massive fiery blade, Ignis challenges all who dare enter his domain, striking down those unworthy of surviving the trial by fire."
				""
				"To continue your journey across the stars, you must step into the arena and face him in battle."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/burning_arena_bg.png width:225 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Before you can challenge &cIgnis&r, you must first descend into the dangerous lower levels of the arena."
				""
				"There, powerful &6Blazes&r guard the treasure chambers containing the rare &eDying Embers&r required to awaken the warrior. Fight your way through the burning corridors, claim the embers, and prepare for what lies ahead."
				""
				"Without them, Ignis cannot be summoned."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/dying_embers.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Once enough &eDying Embers&r have been gathered, they must be combined into &6Burning Ashes&r - an offering worthy of summoning the champion of the arena."
				""
				"Ascend to the highest level of the structure and place the Burning Ashes into the &cAltar of Fire&r."
				""
				"The moment the offering is accepted, the arena will awaken."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"This is the battle you came for."
				""
				"As the fires roar around the arena, &cIgnis&r will emerge to challenge you in legendary combat. His attacks are relentless, his defenses immense, and his mastery over flame makes every mistake deadly."
				""
				"Be especially cautious of his sword strikes, which inflict the dangerous &cBlazing Brand&r effect. Each stack weakens the protection provided by your armor, leaving you increasingly vulnerable the longer the fight continues."
				""
				"Stay mobile, manage your positioning carefully, and endure the flames long enough to claim victory."
				""
				"Only the strongest survive the Burning Arena."
			]
			icon: "cataclysm:flame_eye"
