		{
			dependencies: ["25721A33E1238EBD"]
			description: [
				"Hidden among the toxic dunes and relentless acid storms of Venus stands the &6Cursed Pyramid&r, an ancient structure weathered by time yet untouched within."
				""
				"Though its outer walls have eroded beneath the planet’s harsh atmosphere, the inner corridors remain preserved, concealing forgotten treasures, deadly guardians, and a terrifying force buried deep beneath the sands."
				""
				"To continue your journey toward &5The End&r, you must brave the pyramid’s labyrinth and awaken the ancient power sealed within."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/cursed_pyramid_bg.png width:225 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As you explore the twisting halls of the pyramid, you will encounter hordes of hostile &eKoboleltons&r guarding its treasures and passageways."
				""
				"These relentless skeletal warriors stand between you and the deeper chambers of the structure. Defeat at least 10 Koboleltons as you search the pyramid and continue your ascent through the labyrinth toward the upper levels."
				""
				"Every corridor brings you closer to what sleeps below."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"After reaching the central peak of the pyramid, your path will lead toward a hidden side chamber concealed within the ruins."
				""
				"Buried beneath suspicious sand lies the powerful &6Necklace of the Desert&r, an ancient relic required to awaken the being sealed beneath the pyramid. Search carefully, uncover the artifact, and prepare yourself before descending into the structure’s hidden depths."
				""
				"Once you enter, there is no easy escape."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/necklace_of_the_desert.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Guarding the tomb of the ancient ruler are two powerful protectors: the &cKobeldiator&r and &2Wadjet&r."
				""
				"These formidable guardians must be defeated before the path to the final chamber can be opened. Work carefully through the arena, survive their assaults, and claim access to the resting place hidden below the pyramid."
				""
				"Only then may the true challenge begin."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"At the heart of the tomb rests the remains of the &4Ancient Remnant&r, silent beneath centuries of sand and ruin."
				""
				"Place the &6Necklace of the Desert&r upon the remains and watch as the ancient bones begin to reform before your eyes. The chamber will awaken, and the Ancient Remnant will rise to challenge you in battle."
				""
				"Defeat this forgotten ruler, and you will move one step closer to unlocking the path to &5The End&r."
			]
			icon: "cataclysm:desert_eye"
			id: "18C76E4350AC3CBC"
			rewards: [
