		{
			dependencies: ["6B54577F45BDF5E7"]
			description: [
				"&7Mercury is a world of relentless heat, shattered terrain, and ancient ruins left to burn beneath the endless glare of the sun.&r"
				""
				"Despite the planet’s harsh conditions, powerful structures still stand upon its scorched surface - remnants of forgotten civilizations and dangerous strongholds consumed by fire and ruin."
				""
				"Those brave enough to explore Mercury may uncover valuable treasures, deadly enemies, and secrets buried within the planet’s molten wastelands."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lForbidden Castle&r"
				"Rising from Mercury’s blazing landscape, the &4Forbidden Castle&r stands as a massive fortress consumed by darkness and fire. Its towering walls and ruined halls are filled with dangerous enemies, hidden loot, and powerful relics left behind by those who once ruled within."
				""
				"The deeper you venture into the castle, the greater the danger becomes."
				""
				"Only well-prepared adventurers will survive its burning corridors."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/forbidden_castle.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lMercury Arena Dungeon&r"
				"Hidden among the scorched terrain lies the deadly &6Mercury Arena Dungeon&r, an ancient battleground where powerful enemies await challengers foolish enough to enter."
				""
				"Within these arenas, survival is earned through combat alone. Defeat the foes guarding the structure to claim valuable rewards and resources that may aid your continued progression across the solar system."
				""
				"On Mercury, strength is the only path forward."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/mercury_arena_dungeon.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:red_flag"
			id: "305D28C167DCC07E"
