		{
			dependencies: ["25721A33E1238EBD"]
			description: [
				"&7Beneath the dense clouds and toxic atmosphere of Venus lie the remnants of strange civilizations and overgrown ruins hidden within the planet’s hostile wilderness.&r"
				""
				"Though the surface of Venus is dangerous and unforgiving, explorers willing to brave its extreme conditions will discover valuable structures filled with rare resources, hidden loot, and dangerous enemies guarding the secrets of the planet."
				""
				"Every expedition deeper into Venus brings both great risk and great reward."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lVenus Tree Dungeon&r"
				"Towering high above the toxic terrain, the massive &2Venus Tree Dungeon&r has become overgrown with dangerous vegetation and hostile creatures. Hidden within its twisting roots and ancient chambers are valuable rewards waiting to be uncovered."
				""
				"Navigating the structure’s vertical design and surviving the enemies within will test both your preparation and your combat abilities."
				""
				"The deeper you climb, the more dangerous the dungeon becomes."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/venus_tree_dungeon.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPygro Village&r"
				"Scattered across the hostile surface of Venus are rare &6Pygro Villages&r, settlements inhabited by the mysterious Pygro species. Despite the dangers of the planet, these villages continue to survive beneath the planet’s toxic skies."
				""
				"Within these settlements, you may find useful supplies, trading opportunities, and temporary refuge while exploring the harsh environment of Venus."
				""
				"Not every encounter on Venus must end in battle."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/pygro_village.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPygro Tower&r"
				"Standing tall above the Venusian landscape, the &cPygro Tower&r serves as both a fortress and lookout for the planet’s hostile inhabitants. These dangerous structures are guarded by powerful enemies and contain valuable loot for those capable of reaching the upper levels."
				""
				"Prepare carefully before entering - the towers of Venus are not easily conquered."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/pygro_tower.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:yellow_flag"
