		{
			dependencies: ["05B5C7A592D2E3DA"]
			description: [
				"&7Far beyond the warmth of the inner planets lies Glacio - a frozen world consumed by endless snowstorms, ancient ruins, and forgotten structures buried beneath the ice.&r"
				""
				"Though the planet appears silent and lifeless, powerful remnants of past civilizations still remain scattered across its frozen surface. Those willing to endure the extreme cold may uncover hidden treasures, dangerous enemies, and long-forgotten secrets locked away within the ice."
				""
				"Survival on Glacio demands both preparation and perseverance."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lSanctum&r"
				"Hidden deep within Glacio’s frozen terrain lies the mysterious &bSanctum&r, an ancient structure shrouded in secrecy and surrounded by dangerous enemies. Though time and ice have claimed much of the structure, valuable loot and powerful resources still remain hidden within its frozen halls."
				""
				"Explorers who venture into the Sanctum must remain cautious - not everything buried beneath the ice was meant to be uncovered."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/sanctum.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lGlacio Tower Dungeon&r"
				"Rising high above the snowy wastelands, the &fGlacio Tower Dungeon&r stands as one of the planet’s most dangerous landmarks. Filled with hostile enemies, difficult encounters, and valuable loot, these towering structures challenge adventurers willing to brave the freezing climb to the top."
				""
				"Each floor presents new dangers, but also greater rewards for those strong enough to survive."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/glacio_tower_dungeon.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lMystical Tree&r"
				"Among Glacio’s frozen wilderness, you may encounter the towering &dMystical Tree&r - a rare and ancient structure unlike anything else found on the planet. Glowing with strange energy and surrounded by an eerie silence, these massive trees appear to hold secrets long forgotten by time."
				""
				"Those who explore their roots and branches may uncover hidden loot, rare resources, and clues about the mysterious history of Glacio itself."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/mystical_tree.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:light_blue_flag"
			id: "120B595432CA7CEE"
