		{
			dependencies: ["05B5C7A592D2E3DA"]
			description: [
				"Buried deep within the frozen wastelands of Glacio stands the &bFrosted Prison&r - a massive fortress built to contain the most dangerous beings ever known."
				""
				"Within its icy depths lies the sealed tomb of &4Maledictus&r, a legendary warrior whose destruction once threatened entire civilizations. After his defeat, he was imprisoned beneath layers of frozen stone and ancient magic, hidden away where none could ever awaken him again."
				""
				"But the prison still stands."
				""
				"And those who venture too deep may unleash the horror sealed within."
				""
				"To continue your journey toward &5The End&r, you must descend into the Frosted Prison and confront the evil buried at its core."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/fancymenu_image_3.png width:225 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The outer halls of the prison are patrolled by relentless &7Draugr&r, ancient undead warriors tasked with preventing intruders from reaching the inner sanctum."
				""
				"These guardians will stop at nothing to defend the prison and ensure Maledictus remains sealed forever. Fight your way through the frozen corridors, survive the prison’s deadly defenses, and continue descending deeper into the fortress."
				""
				"Every step forward brings you closer to awakening what should have remained buried."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Deep within the prison awaits the monstrous &cAptrgangr&r, a powerful guardian entrusted with protecting the seal to Maledictus’ tomb."
				""
				"Defeat the Aptrgangr to obtain the mysterious &6Strange Key&r, the only artifact capable of unlocking the massive &7Door of Seal&r guarding the final chamber."
				""
				"Beyond that door lies the prison’s darkest secret."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"At the heart of the Frosted Prison stands a cursed tombstone, silent beneath the frozen air."
				""
				"Right-click the &8Cursed Tombstone&r to awaken &4Maledictus&r from his slumber and begin the final battle."
				""
				"Beware his deadly bow attacks - they strike with incredible speed and devastating power, capable of eliminating unprepared adventurers in moments. Stay mobile, manage your positioning carefully, and prepare for an unforgiving encounter."
				""
				"Should you prevail against Maledictus, you will move one step closer to unlocking the path to &5The End&r."
			]
