		{
			dependencies: ["136F876B233BB6D3"]
			description: [
				"Forged from the bitter remnants of a frozen age, the &bCold Eye&r stands as the last legacy of the vanished Iceologers-an artifact of mystery, power, and chilling beauty.  "
				""
				"Each fragment needed to restore the Cold Eye lies hidden deep within the frozen wastelands of &9Ad Astra's Glacio&r-a world of endless ice and peril.  "
				"The following pages will guide you through where to find each essential component."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lPermafrost&r:  "
				"  Fragments of ancient frozen soil found scattered across the surface of &eGlacio&r. Harvest carefully-its cold runs deeper than the ice itself.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/glacio_screenshot.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lBlack Steel Block&r:  "
				"  Rarely found in the frozen vaults of the &eFrosted Prison&r, this precious ingot was once used by Glacio's forgotten civilizations to craft weapons strong enough to endure eternal winter.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/prison.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lCursium Ingot&r:  "
				"  A cursed metal forged from the remains of Maledictus-the fearsome boss of Cataclysm. Only by defeating this frozen horror can you claim the ingot needed to complete the Cold Eye.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/male.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nTread carefully, explorer.&r  "
				"Glacio is no ordinary planet-it is a tomb of forgotten empires and lingering curses. Only those with strength, courage, and an undying flame within will forge the &bFrozen Legacy&r and awaken the true power of the Cold Eye."
			]
