			dependencies: ["05B5C7A592D2E3DA"]
			description: ["As you journey across the &bGlacian Surface&r, you will uncover mysterious resource &6vents&r hidden throughout the landscape. Each &6vent&r holds the potential to fuel powerful automation lines and unlock new methods of resource production for your growing factory. Below, you will learn more about every &6vent&r, where they can be found, and the unique opportunities they bring to your adventure."]
