		{
			dependencies: ["4DDD2511F45D67AD"]
			description: [
				"Hidden on the frostbitten crust of &bGlacio&r lies the &bFrostite Vent&r-a rare frozen geyser vital to powering &9Etrium&r production. Its crystalline surface pulses with dormant energy, waiting for a spark to awaken its true potential."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/frostite_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To awaken this vent, place &la blaze burner&r directly atop it and feed it blaze cake. The tranformation will crack the ice, activating the vent and preparing it to channel molten fluids."
